# PARSIFAL ChangeLog
# Ordered from most recent to oldest (YYYY-MM-DD)

[2026-11-25] - RF / AI
- Added automated deterministic regression test suite (tests/regression_test.sh, tests/check_regression.py, tests/baseline.json) verifying APV, TIGER, and TORA bit-for-bit across OpenMP thread counts.
- Added runtime CLI overrides to Simulate (--seed, --nevents, --bfield, --no-noise, --no-sat, --no-fft, --plot-hits, --tora-shaper <1|3>) backed by inline switches in src/Common/Common.h, and PARSIFAL_data support in Analysis.
- Enabled automatic header dependency tracking (-MMD -MP) in Makefile and eliminated remaining -Wall warnings across all modules (except Readout::Get_Charge_TORA, left unchanged).
- Major performance optimizations: replaced 13 heap TH1D* per ElectronicChannel with lightweight vector-backed Waveform class, skipped APV Fermi-Dirac fits below threshold, replaced sin() loops in Readout::Background() with exact sin/cos recurrence, truncated negligible shaper kernel tails with __restrict__ pointers (~8.5x APV and ~1.6x TIGER speedup at 2 threads).
- Fixed residual bugs: deterministic per-module RNG seeding when SEED > 0 (persistent TRandom3 in Ionization + gRandom seeding), bounded Landau fit with peak fallback in main_ana (prevents negative Qind MPV), Yview ion tail and t_ele indexing in Readout, removed unused TF1 f[n_ns] array, fixed Get_TPC() canvas/double-fit and primi clearing in Reconstruction, fixed Plot_PDF_Channels() leaks, and removed obsolete source files.
- Updated and synchronized README, README.md, and ChangeLog across project branches.
- Refactored src/Plot/HVscan.C to support parametric APV and TIGER comparison modes against experimental data.
- Updated run_list.txt APV scan (runs 30-39) event counts from 100 to 1000.
- Added log/ to .gitignore and created the Parsifal-AI development branch.

[2026-11-24] - RF / AI
- Fixed critical physics and reconstruction bugs: uninitialized y in Ionization, premature Primary destructor call, inverted fastest-cluster comparison in Reconstruction, triple-GEM collection efficiency in fast_simulation, MagField propagation in Signal/DetectorGain/ElectronDrift, 200-entry secondary ionization CDF, APV SumQ binning, TIGER threshold guards, capacitive cap_charge_2, unreachable Phiview branch, and NTuple sentinel values.
- Fixed OpenMP data races in Resistive::Resist() (parallelized over destination channel, fixed off-by-one and t == t0 singularity) and Readout::Background() (thread-local TRandom3 with pre-generated seeds).
- Fixed memory leaks and ROOT ownership: detached internal ElectronicChannel TH1Ds via SetDirectory(nullptr), replaced explicit destructor calls with delete, re-enabled FreeMemory(), reused and freed FFT plans in Filtering(), and fixed Readout/Cluster1D cleanup.
- Fixed Makefile (-O2 -Wall), PARSIFAL.sh (shebang, pdf/backup handling, full run_list lookup), main_sim/main_ana exit codes (0 on success, 1 on error), and parallel summary.txt write race in main_ana.
- Added per-angle human-readable simulation report data/<run>/info_sim_angle<deg>.txt with timestamps, runtime, and run configuration.
- Optimized performance at unchanged physics: precomputed shaper kernels in Readout::Integration(), precomputed symmetric kernel table in Resistive::Resist(), cached TF1::GetRandom() in DetectorGain, N0 fit option in Measure_Time_APV, and disabled default per-event PDF plotting (print_plot_above_thr = 0).
- Validated APV (runs 30-39) and TIGER (runs 10-24) HV scans (16,000 events total) against experimental data.

